<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P assigns A-1 rating to Kiwi Co-op short notes.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A-1 rating to Kiwi Co-op short notes.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rating agency Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday it had assigned its A-1 short term rating to Kiwi Co-operative Dairies Limited's NZ$300 million short-term notes.</p>
<p>The long term rating on Kiwi, assigned in early June, was affirmed at A+, and S&amp;P called the producer company's rating outlook stable.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
